      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "fca266f0-7d9d-4096-86b6-2c02f228e2ab",
      "name": "Sticky Note3"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Valida Senha\n\n**Processo:**\n1. Converte hash PHP→Node\n   ($2y$ → $2a$)\n2. bcrypt.compare()\n   - Plain password\n   - Hash do banco\n\n**Compatibilidade:**\nAlgoritmos idênticos\napenas prefixo difere",
        "height": 832,
        "width": 288,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
